WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:03.360
I once asked my class to
stop and answer one question.

2
00:00:04.180 --> 00:00:05.260
How do you define love?

3
00:00:06.090 --> 00:00:08.310
When I was in high school,
I visited my grandparents.

4
00:00:08.820 --> 00:00:12.150
One read the paper on one side of the
room, the other on the other side.

5
00:00:12.630 --> 00:00:14.120
Day after day, for years.

6
00:00:14.780 --> 00:00:16.730
One day I asked them how they define love.

7
00:00:17.250 --> 00:00:17.800
They laughed.

8
00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:19.810
It's just a feeling, they said.

9
00:00:20.240 --> 00:00:21.700
They felt each other's presence.

10
00:00:22.100 --> 00:00:22.850
That was all.

11
00:00:23.090 --> 00:00:24.880
They weren't overly loving people.

12
00:00:25.460 --> 00:00:26.950
They came from the Great Depression.

13
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:29.610
So how much of that shapes us?

14
00:00:30.190 --> 00:00:32.390
How would you answer my
grandparents' question?

